### Paperless DMS - REST API Tests (Sprint 1: Document Upload)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api

### 1. Retrieve all documents (initial list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents
Accept: application/json

### 2. Upload Document with explicit title (First Use Case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Annual Tax Report 2026
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample-documents/sample.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

### 3. Upload Document without title (defaults to filename)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./sample-documents/sample.txt
--WebAppBoundary--

### 4. Upload Document error handling (Empty file should return 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Empty Test
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="empty.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf


--WebAppBoundary--

### 5. Retrieve all documents (verify uploaded documents appear)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents
Accept: application/json

### 6. Retrieve uploaded document by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. Search for uploaded document by title query
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/search?query=Tax
Accept: application/json
